# forky's xfsprogs (7.x) ships xfs_healer@.service with DefaultInstance=- (the
# root, /). Its ExecCondition `xfs_healer --supported /` exits 255, not a skip
# code, when / is not XFS, and the root of a snosi system is always a composefs
# overlay: the unit fails at every boot (frostyard/snosi#1326). Only the
# default root instance is disabled; xfs_healer_start.service still starts a
# healer for each XFS mount. trixie's xfsprogs has no healer, so this file is a
# no-op there.
#
# This is its own file, not a line in 03-core.preset: the product trees
# (shared/snow/tree, shared/floe/tree) ship their own 03-core.preset, which
# replaces base's. No product tree may ship a 07-xfs-healer.preset.
# test/xfs-healer-preset-test.sh checks every composition with systemctl --root.
disable xfs_healer@.service
